{"meta":{"id":"request-session-cookie","category":"it/syntax/java/servlet","title":"데이터 전달 (request · session · cookie) · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"setAttribute 로 보내기, getParameter · getCookies 로 받기, 제거, 범위와 쿠키 인코딩","tags":["java","f-web-scope","f-network","세션"],"color":"cyan","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-cyan","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-cyan-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">데이터 전달 (request · session · cookie) · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> setAttribute 로 보내기, getParameter · getCookies 로 받기, 제거, 범위와 쿠키 인코딩</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">보내기 (Out)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">request.setAttribute(&quot;변수명&quot;, 전송값);        // 이번 요청 동안만 (forward 대상까지)\r\nsession.setAttribute(&quot;키&quot;, &quot;값&quot;);             // 브라우저(사용자)별, 로그아웃 · 만료 전까지\r\napplication.setAttribute(&quot;키&quot;, &quot;값&quot;);         // 서버 전체 공유 (ServletContext)\r\n\r\n// 쿠키 — 브라우저에 저장\r\nCookie cookie = new Cookie(&quot;aMidA&quot;, URLEncoder.encode(value, &quot;UTF-8&quot;));\r\ncookie.setMaxAge(60 * 60 * 24);              // 만료 시간(초) — 1일\r\nresponse.addCookie(cookie);</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">받기 (In)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">String mid = request.getParameter(&quot;mid&quot;);            // form · 쿼리스트링 값 (get, post 모두)\r\nString[] hobbies = request.getParameterValues(&quot;hobby&quot;); // 같은 name 이 여러 개 (체크박스)\r\n\r\nint age = request.getParameter(&quot;age&quot;) == null ? 0 : Integer.parseInt(request.getParameter(&quot;age&quot;));  // null 처리\r\n\r\nString sMid = (String) session.getAttribute(&quot;sMid&quot;);\r\n\r\nfor (Cookie ck : request.getCookies()) {\r\n    if (ck.getName().equals(&quot;aMidA&quot;)) {\r\n        String v = URLDecoder.decode(ck.getValue(), &quot;UTF-8&quot;);\r\n        ck.getMaxAge();                                  // 만료 시간\r\n    }\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">제거</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">session.removeAttribute(&quot;sMid&quot;);     // 하나 제거\r\nsession.invalidate();                // 세션 전체 종료 (로그아웃)\r\napplication.removeAttribute(&quot;키&quot;);\r\n\r\nCookie del = new Cookie(&quot;aMidA&quot;, &quot;&quot;);\r\ndel.setMaxAge(0);                     // 만료 시간 0 → 브라우저가 삭제\r\nresponse.addCookie(del);</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">범위 · 주의</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">범위가 좁은 순서: page &lt; request &lt; session &lt; application — EL 에서 같은 이름이면 좁은 범위부터 찾는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">쿠키 값에는 공백 · 특수문자(=, ; 등)를 그대로 넣을 수 없다 — 저장 전 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>URLEncoder.encode</code>, 읽은 뒤 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>URLDecoder.decode</code></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">HTML 에서 name 이 중복되면 배열로 전달된다 — getParameter 는 첫 값만 반환하므로 getParameterValues 로 받는다</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> JSP › 데이터 통신, Spring › @RequestParam</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/servlet/request-session-cookie","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"servlet","title":"서블릿 (웹)","path":"it/syntax/java/servlet"}],"hasImage":false}